mac80211_hwsim: add optional deterministic rate-aware PER

Layer an opt-in packet error approximation over the kernel-medium link
matrix.  The model derives SNR from the selected link signal and an explicit
noise floor, maps legacy/HT/VHT rates to a required SNR, and applies a small
deterministic loss curve near that threshold.  Configured matrix loss remains
independent and the two percentages are combined.

The model is disabled by default and is intentionally described as a lab
approximation rather than an RF-accurate PHY.  Expose its last decision and
counters in the existing debugfs readback so experiments are auditable.

